            "notes": "round 2\n\nPick  [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) and  [Mid-Air Mobilizer](item_760c1441-8cfa-426c-885d-8d0dec32e145).\nYou might ask why not  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) ?\nIt's because Mercy healing per second scaling from both ATK SPD and WP. Both of them combined is multiplicative not additive. All you have to do is to stay in air for huge advantage!\nHeal per second data compared to Talon:\n15% WP 35% AS 97.2 HPS w/o Talon\n25% WP 15% AS 86.7 HPS w/ Talon",
